;padding:10px 5px;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;overflow:hidden;word-break:normal;vertical-align:top\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">Opening statements</font></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;padding:10px 5px;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;overflow:hidden;word-break:normal;vertical-align:top\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">9:00 AM - 10:00 AM</font></td><td style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;padding:10px 5px;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;overflow:hidden;word-break:normal;vertical-align:top\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">Dev talk: Andrew Gelman</font></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;padding:10px 5px;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;overflow:hidden;word-break:normal;vertical-align:top\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">10:00 AM - 10:30 AM</font></td><td style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;padding:10px 5px;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;overflow:hidden;word-break:normal;vertical-align:top\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">Coffee</font></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;padding:10px 5px;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;overflow:hidden;word-break:normal;vertical-align:top\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">10:30 AM - 12:00 PM</font></td><td style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;padding:10px 5px;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;overflow:hidden;word-break:normal;vertical-align:top\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">Contributed talks (5 talks)</font></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;padding:10px 5px;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;overflow:hidden;word-break:normal;vertical-align:top\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">12:00 PM - 1:15 PM</font></td><td style=\"font-family